      "mergedPostDetails": "Honestly, they need to either remove or give the option to remove/set the amount of film grain in photos. I like using the Focus setting on the camera but the amount of it in the picture bugs me.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[Feature Request] Film Grain Removal",
